---
// Start a business outside Morgantown: Star City, Granville, Westover and
// places outside any town (#640, part of #277). Which town you are in decides
// the local license and B&O form. Each town's part comes from its own site.
// Westover is page text, not a record, until the city-of-westover org lands
// (PR #675). Fees, rates and due dates are left off: no town page states them.
// Waits for David (tax).
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { fixFormUrl } from '../lib/group-requests.mjs';
import ResourceCard from '../components/ResourceCard.astro';
import SourceLine from '../components/SourceLine.astro';
import { resource } from '../lib/content.mjs';
import Fact from '../components/Fact.astro';
import { factsFor } from '../lib/facts.mjs';
export const page = { door: "family", topic: "work", label: "Start a business in Star City, Granville or Westover", summary: "Which town you are in decides the local business license and B&O tax form" };
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
// The Westover contact and forms lines are fact records (#122), read
// 2026-11-14 (Eastern). The fee, rate and due-date sentence stays typed (tax).
const fact = factsFor('business-by-town');
const westover = [{ url: 'https://www.westoverwv.org/_files/ugd/d2114f_50052056caff40fc91000a6134690e2d.pdf', checked: '2026-11-02' }, { url: 'https://www.westoverwv.org/_files/ugd/d2114f_2a62a2f3faff47e4b511dff8e8e48a52.pdf', checked: '2026-11-02' }];
---
<Base title="Start a business in Star City, Granville or Westover, Mon County, WV" description="Your town decides your business license and B&O tax form. The Star City, Granville and Westover forms and offices, and who to ask outside any town in Mon County.">
  <h1>Start a business in Star City, Granville or Westover</h1>
  <p class="lede">Businesses in West Virginia register with the state first. After that, the town your business is in decides which local license and B&O (business and occupation) tax form you need. Check which town your business is in. Each part below comes from that town's own website.</p>
  <p>State registration and free help: see <a href={`${base}/business/`}>Start or grow a business</a>. Inside Morgantown city limits: see the city's <a href="https://www.morgantownwv.gov/247/Steps-to-Starting-Your-Business">Steps to Starting Your Business</a>.</p>
  <SourceLine sources={[{ url: 'https://www.morgantownwv.gov/247/Steps-to-Starting-Your-Business', checked: '2026-10-30' }]} about="Morgantown steps to starting a business" />

  <h2>Star City</h2>
  {resource('star-city-business-registration') && <ResourceCard r={resource('star-city-business-registration')} />}
  <p>Every business type and fee on the town's form: <a href={`${base}/star-city-business-license/`}>Star City business license fees</a>.</p>

  <h2>Granville</h2>
  {resource('granville-business-license') && <ResourceCard r={resource('granville-business-license')} />}

  <h2>Westover</h2>
  <article class="card resource" id="westover-new-businesses">
    <h3>Westover business forms</h3>
    <Fact f={fact('westover-get-started')} about="getting started with the City of Westover" />
    <Fact f={fact('westover-business-forms')} about="the Westover business forms" />
    <Fact f={fact('westover-other-forms')} about="other Westover forms" />
    <p>The New Businesses page itself does not list fees or rates, but two of the forms do. The Business License Application (dated April 27, 2023) lists a yearly fee for each kind of business, and says licenses run on a fiscal year ending June 30. The B&O tax return (revised July 1, 2024) lists the tax rates and says each return is due 30 days after the quarter ends (March 31, June 30, September 30 and December 31). Ask the city if the forms are still current before you pay.</p>
    <SourceLine sources={westover} about="the Westover license fees and B&O tax forms" />
    <Fact f={fact('westover-office')} about="the Westover city office" />
    <Fact f={fact('westover-paperwork-email')} about="Westover paperwork questions" />
    <p>Every fee and rate from the two forms, as a short list: <a href={`${base}/westover-business-license/`}>Westover business license fees and B&amp;O tax</a>.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="https://www.westoverwv.org/new-businesses"><span>Westover business forms</span></a></p>
  </article>

  <h2>Outside any town</h2>
  {resource('mon-county-planning-permits') && <ResourceCard r={resource('mon-county-planning-permits')} />}

  <p class="meta">Sources checked October 30, 2026. Most of these town pages do not list license fees, B&O rates or due dates, so call the town office before you pay or file. We describe the steps; we do not decide what applies to your business. Something out of date? <a href={fixFormUrl({ page: Astro.url.pathname })}>Tell us</a>.</p>
</Base>
